<title>USA: Apertus to cut staff, write off inventory.</title>
<headline>Apertus to cut staff, write off inventory.</headline>
<dateline>EDEN PRAIRIE 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apertus Technologies Inc said Thursday it plans to reduce its workforce and write off some inventory to adjust expense levels in anticipation of lower revenues for its fiscal year 1998.</p>
<p>Robert Gordon, chairman, chief executive officer and president of the company said, that with the expense changes and introduction of new products, Apertus &quot;has a good opportunity to achieve its goal of returning to profitability in FY 1998.&quot;</p>
</text>
